You have to keep an eye on the plumbing and electrical.

564
00:29:50,559 --> 00:29:51,039
Right.

565
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:51,960
You're all busy enough.

566
00:29:52,039 --> 00:29:54,319
Don't waste your time on me.

567
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,000
Listen to me.

568
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:57,000
Because of the renovation,

569
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:59,200
my place is a mess. There's nowhere for you to sit.

570
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,880
It's too messy here. Nowhere to sit.

571
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:01,839
We can find someone else.

572
00:30:01,839 --> 00:30:03,279
Right, no problem. We have plenty of colleagues.

573
00:30:03,279 --> 00:30:04,279
I'm free anytime.

574
00:30:04,759 --> 00:30:06,960
No, I just want some peace and quiet alone.

575
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:07,720
I just want

576
00:30:13,599 --> 00:30:14,240
some peace.

577
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:15,640
Listen to me, everyone.

578
00:30:16,039 --> 00:30:17,240
My house is getting renovated.

579
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:18,640
It's a total mess here.

580
00:30:18,640 --> 00:30:20,039
I have nowhere to host you.

581
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:22,519
Also, I want some peace and quiet to myself.

582
00:30:22,839 --> 00:30:24,680
I don't want anyone bothering me.

583
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:31,119
Is that clear to everyone?

584
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:32,480
Clear. Court adjourned.

585
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:43,119
Should I make some noodles then?

586
00:30:43,119 --> 00:30:44,079
For a late-night snack.

587
00:30:44,079 --> 00:30:45,759
None of you really ate well, right?

588
00:30:46,759 --> 00:30:47,559
Eat...

589
00:30:47,559 --> 00:30:48,640
All right, we...

590
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:50,839
It's getting late. Let's get going.

591
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:52,039
The boss is still calling me.

592
00:30:52,079 --> 00:30:53,599
Right, right. We have work tomorrow.

593
00:30:53,599 --> 00:30:54,279
Sorry about that. So sorry.

594
00:30:54,279 --> 00:30:55,079
It won't take long to make some noodles.

595
00:30:55,079 --> 00:30:55,680
No need, no need.

596
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:56,640
Have a bowl of noodles before you go.

597
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:57,960
At least have some noodles before you go.

598
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:58,839
Get some early rest.

599
00:30:58,839 --> 00:30:59,680
No, really.

600
00:30:59,759 --> 00:31:01,640
Come on, Lao Yu. We've talked too much.

601
00:31:01,640 --> 00:31:03,279
Really, don't be mad.

602
00:31:03,279 --> 00:31:04,279
Sorry to bother you.

603
00:31:04,279 --> 00:31:05,480
Have some noodles, okay?

604
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:06,559
We'll pass. We'll pass.

605
00:31:06,559 --> 00:31:07,680
We'll leave the stuff here then.

606
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:08,640
No need to clean it up. No need.

607
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:09,559
You're really not mad?

608
00:31:09,559 --> 00:31:10,279
I'm not mad.

609
00:31:10,279 --> 00:31:11,720
Cai... Deputy Cai.

610
00:31:12,599 --> 00:31:13,279
You're good.

611
00:31:13,279 --> 00:31:14,839
Sorry about that, Judge Wu. Judge Wu.

612
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:16,000
Take care on your way out.

613
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:16,720
We're leaving now.

614
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:17,839
Call me if you need anything.

615
00:31:17,839 --> 00:31:18,680
Of course, of course.

616
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:19,359
Call anytime if you need something.

617
00:31:19,359 --> 00:31:20,920
We have plenty of time. Anytime.

618
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:21,839
It might be raining outside.

619
00:31:21,839 --> 00:31:22,640
Do you want to take an umbrella?

620
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,000
No thanks. No thanks.

621
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:23,359
We're good. We're good.

622
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,079
No need, no need.

623
00:31:24,079 --> 00:31:25,039
Get some good rest.

624
00:31:25,039 --> 00:31:25,920
Alright. Okay, okay.

625
00:32:00,559 --> 00:32:03,039
Xiao Zhou, go give them a hand over there.

626
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:04,359
On it.

627
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:09,519
Sir, what kind of project is this?

628
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:11,400
This place is getting demolished.

629
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:14,359
The bridge is being demolished?

630
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:15,519
Yeah, it's coming down.

631
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:19,400
Xiao Zhou, tell them to hurry it up!

632
00:32:24,720 --> 00:32:26,559
I see you really like running around here.

633
00:32:28,079 --> 00:32:32,720
Because I like looking at the scenery around here.

634
00:32:34,839 --> 00:32:37,559
Is there anything special about it?

635
00:32:39,119 --> 00:32:40,839
Nine years ago, my...

636
00:32:42,279 --> 00:32:45,279
...wife and son had an accident near here.

637
00:32:53,079 --> 00:32:54,599
So I feel like...

638
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:57,960
I can see what they...

639
00:32:59,559 --> 00:33:02,240
...might have seen in their final moments.

640
00:33:08,559 --> 00:33:12,240
And everyone tells me to let it go.

641
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:15,279
To look ahead and move on.

642
00:33:17,119 --> 00:33:17,839
They...

643
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,720
But they don't understand.

644
00:33:23,759 --> 00:33:25,240
For people like us,

645
00:33:26,359 --> 00:33:27,480
no matter which way we go,

646
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,160
it's never forward.

647
00:33:30,279 --> 00:33:31,519
It's always back to the past.

648
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,840
Hello? Who's this?

649
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,400
It's Yang Cheng.

650
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:31,480
Ms. Ding.

651
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:33,000
Conditions here in the village are pretty basic.

652
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:34,039
Sorry you had to rough it.

653
00:34:34,039 --> 00:34:34,719
It's fine.

654
00:34:34,719 --> 00:34:35,480
When you get back,

655
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,679
be sure to pass on a message for me.

656
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:38,599
Thank Zhao Yijie and the others

657
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:41,400
for donating money and supplies to us all these years.

658
00:34:42,679 --> 00:34:43,320
Will do.

659
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,159
Ding Ning.

660
00:34:46,679 --> 00:34:48,239
Saw you.

661
00:34:51,199 --> 00:34:51,960
Awu.

662
00:34:52,320 --> 00:34:54,480
It's "see you", not "saw you".

663
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,159
But that's not wrong either.

664
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,440
You saw me,

665
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,440
and I saw you.

666
00:35:01,679 --> 00:35:02,400
See you.

667
00:35:03,519 --> 00:35:05,440
Do you know how to write "Ding Ning"?

668
00:35:11,519 --> 00:35:12,800
It's written like this.

669
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:13,880
Remember,

670
00:35:14,719 --> 00:35:15,960
my phone number is on there.

671
00:35:16,079 --> 00:35:18,000
You can call me anytime, okay?

672
00:35:22,119 --> 00:35:22,719
Trade.

673
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,239
You really like this?

674
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:41,119
Alright.

675
00:35:42,039 --> 00:35:43,159
Keep it as a souvenir.

676
00:35:48,039 --> 00:35:49,360
Then I'll keep this as a souvenir too.

677
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:55,360
Let's go, Mr. Ye.

678
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:56,840
We're off.

679
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:30,039
Nothing is more complex than people.

680
00:36:31,239 --> 00:36:32,679
And we can never fully know

681
00:36:32,679 --> 00:36:33,880
everything about a person.

682
00:36:35,199 --> 00:36:36,360
I often wonder

683
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:39,880
if some seemingly kindhearted people

684
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:43,079
secretly harbor unspeakable secrets.

685
00:36:44,719 --> 00:36:45,639
Similarly,

686
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:48,199
no matter how heinous a person may be,

687
00:36:48,559 --> 00:36:50,360
there is still someone out there who touches

688
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:51,880
the softest part of their heart.

689
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:54,840
This person could be their child,

690
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:57,440
or someone completely unrelated.

691
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:01,559
No one falls into the abyss for no reason.

692
00:37:02,480 --> 00:37:04,480
But no matter what they have become now,

693
00:37:05,639 --> 00:37:07,400
there will always be someone who remembers

694
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,880
who they were in the very beginning.

695
00:37:27,039 --> 00:37:28,480
Hello, this is Ding Ning.

696
00:37:29,239 --> 00:37:30,440
I know you're currently busy with

697
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:32,000
the death penalty review of a drug dealer.

698
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:33,639
The thing is,

699
00:37:34,239 --> 00:37:35,360
in your original case,

700
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:36,840
a witness testified that

701
00:37:37,159 --> 00:37:39,280
this dealer was the ringleader of a drug cartel,

702
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:40,760
which led to his death sentence.

703
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:42,800
But while following a lead

704
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,599
from a sexual assault case I'm handling, I discovered

705
00:37:45,079 --> 00:37:47,719
this person is a habitual liar and perjurer.

706
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,199
I'll send you

707
00:37:49,199 --> 00:37:50,920
the relevant supporting documents shortly.

708
00:37:53,559 --> 00:37:54,199
Okay.

709
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:02,719
I'll be right outside.

710
00:39:02,719 --> 00:39:04,239
Just call me if you need anything.

711
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:32,559
Have a seat.

712
00:39:41,719 --> 00:39:45,119
We finally meet.

713
00:39:47,679 --> 00:39:49,079
All these years...

714
00:39:53,599 --> 00:39:55,519
I've lived with regret.

715
00:39:57,760 --> 00:39:58,840
I let you down.

716
00:40:16,239 --> 00:40:17,440
I've let you down, too.

717
00:40:24,559 --> 00:40:25,840
Did you know?

718
00:40:29,159 --> 00:40:32,119
You have a grandson named Yang Awu.

719
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:36,559
He's your son's child.

720
00:40:41,599 --> 00:40:43,760
He's our shared grandson.
